  "limitations": "Health statistics are derived from CDC PLACES model-based estimates at the county level. County-level averages may mask significant within-county variation across census tracts, particularly in a large and diverse county like Fairfax. Exposure layers are modeled or interpolated from monitoring stations; local spatial resolution is limited. Traffic proximity data from EJScreen reflects proximity to major roads, not individual exposure. Model predictions are trained on state/regional data and may not capture Fairfax-specific drivers such as data center growth, rapid transit development, and changing demographics.",
